      "id": "bug-009",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T11:33:21Z",
      "error_message": "App crashes immediately on first launch after adding setup screen — NPE on _binding!! in HomeFragment.observeData()",
      "file": "android-app/app/src/main/java/com/musichub/ui/fragment/HomeFragment.kt",
      "root_cause": "HomeFragment is the nav start destination so it creates its view immediately. MainActivity then navigates to SetupFragment, destroying HomeFragment's view (_binding = null). The StateFlow collectors launched with viewLifecycleOwner.lifecycleScope.launch { collectLatest } have a race window where one final emission can fire after onDestroyView() before the scope fully cancels.",
      "fix": "Wrapped both collectors inside viewLifecycleOwner.repeatOnLifecycle(Lifecycle.State.STARTED). This suspends the entire block when the fragment stops and resumes it when it starts again — no emission can reach the binding access while the view is destroyed.",
      "tags": [
        "crash",
        "lifecycle",
        "coroutines",
        "stateflow",
        "binding",
        "navigation"
      ],
      "related_bugs": [
        "bug-005"
      ],
      "occurrences": 1,
      "last_seen": "2026-05-07T11:33:21Z"
    },
