      "id": "bug-026",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T12:00:00Z",
      "error_message": "Auto-advance always times out and skips songs; music plays but Music Hub can't detect playback state. Affects all platforms in both foreground and background mode.",
      "file": "android-app/app/src/main/java/com/musichub/MusicHubApplication.kt",
      "root_cause": "After APK reinstall on HyperOS, the system left NotificationListenerService unbound even though the user's permission was still granted. dumpsys notification's 'Live notification listeners' section did not contain MediaMonitorService, so MediaSession callbacks never reached it. getPlaybackInfo() therefore returned null at the warm-timeout (5s), and PlaybackService treated the song as failed and skipped to next.",
      "fix": "Added NotificationListenerService.requestRebind(ComponentName(ctx, MediaMonitorService::class.java)) call in MusicHubApplication.onCreate(). Adb-side workaround for already-installed builds: cmd notification disallow_listener com.musichub/.service.MediaMonitorService then allow_listener.",
