      "error_message": "Kugou song starts playing correctly but immediately times out and skips: 'Playback timeout: wrong song playing! Expected ABC君, actual 有心的定不止五六个'",
      "file": "android-app/app/src/main/java/com/musichub/service/PlaybackService.kt",
      "root_cause": "Kugou (like NetEase) cycles current-lyric lines and credit lines (词：方杰, 曲：雷颂德, etc.) through the MediaSession title metadata so the notification/lockscreen shows scrolling lyrics. PlaybackService.schedulePlaybackTimeout used the metadata title to verify the playing song; for Kugou the title flips to a lyric line within ~1-2 seconds, triggering the wrong-song-playing branch and a spurious skip.",
